## Nebula UI System - Practical Usage Patterns

### 1. Directory Structure
The NebulaN project is an Among Us mod (Nebula-based) at `D:\C#解决方案与.cs\NebulaN`. The source code is in `Scripts/` (47 `.cs` files), organized into:
- `Scripts/Core/` — Core systems: PatchManager, HelpPatch, DocumentScreenPatch, StarsManager, Citation, GiftLog, etc.
- `Scripts/Core/API/RankSystem/` — Rank UI (commented out legacy code)
- `Scripts/Roles/` — Role implementations across Crewmate, Impostor, Neutral, Modifier, Ghosts

### 2. Key Namespaces Used
- `Nebula.Modules.GUIWidget` — `GUIWidget` base class for overlay widgets
- `Nebula.Modules.MetaWidget` — `MetaWidgetOld`, `IMetaWidgetOld`, `IMetaParallelPlacableOld`, `CombinedWidgetOld`
- `NebulaAPI.GUI` — Static factory methods: `.Text()`, `.RawText()`, `.Image()`, `.Margin()`, `.HorizontalMargin()`, `.VerticalHolder()`, `.HorizontalHolder()`, `.LocalizedTextComponent()`, `.GetAttribute()`
- `MetaScreen` — Window/screen object with `.GenerateWindow()`, `.SetWidget()`, `.SetBackImage()`, `.CloseScreen()`

### 3. Creating Windows (MetaScreen)

**Primary pattern: `MetaScreen.GenerateWindow()`**
```csharp
var window = MetaScreen.GenerateWindow(
    new(7.6f, 4.2f),          // size
    HudManager.Instance.transform, // parent
    new Vector3(0, 0, -50f),   // position
    true, false,               // fullScreen? darkenBackground?
    withCloseButton: true      // show close button
);
window.SetWidget(widget);
// window.CloseScreen() to dismiss
```

**Usage Sites:**
- `PatchManager.OpenRoleSelectWindowUsingTabs()` (line 459 of PatchManager.cs)
- `Imagination.cs` / `ImaginationModifier.cs` — calls `PatchManager.OpenRoleSelectWindowUsingTabs()`
- `Miraclist.cs` — calls `PatchManager.OpenRoleSelectWindowUsingTabs()`

### 4. Composing Layouts (MetaWidgetOld)

**Widget Composition:**
```csharp
MetaWidgetOld widget = new();
MetaWidgetOld inner = new();

// Vertical spacing
inner.Append(new MetaWidgetOld.VerticalMargin(0.1f));

// Horizontal spacing
new MetaWidgetOld.HorizonalMargin(0.12f)

// Combined widgets (horizontal arrangement)
new CombinedWidgetOld(0.5f, widget1, widget2, ...)

// Scroll view
new MetaWidgetOld.ScrollView(new Vector2(7.4f, 4.1f), inner)
{
    Alignment = IMetaWidgetOld.AlignmentOption.Center
};

// Text display
new MetaWidgetOld.Text(TextAttributeOld.BoldAttr)
{
    MyText = new RawTextComponent("text"),
    Alignment = IMetaWidgetOld.AlignmentOption.Center
};

// Grid-style layout with items
inner.Append(ary, item => CreateItemWidget(item), 4, -1, 0, 0.59f);
// Parameters: items, factory, columns, rows, spacingX, spacingY
```

### 5. Creating Buttons

**Core pattern:**
```csharp
new MetaWidgetOld.Button(() => {
    // onClick handler
}, TextAttributeOld.BoldAttr)   // text attribute
{
    RawText = "Button Text",                    // simple text
    // OR
    TranslationKey = "translation.key",         // localized text
    // OR
    MyText = new RawTextComponent("text"),      // TextComponent

    Color = Virial.Color.White,                 // button color
    Alignment = IMetaWidgetOld.AlignmentOption.Center,
    TextHorizonotalExtraMargin = 0.15f,

    // Post-build customization
    PostBuilder = (PassiveButton button, SpriteRenderer renderer, TMPro.TextMeshPro text) => {
        renderer.maskInteraction = SpriteMaskInteraction.VisibleInsideMask;
        // position adjustments, icon additions, etc.
    }
};
```

### 6. Sprites/Images/Loading

**Loading resources:**
```csharp
// Load image from addon resources
NebulaAPI.AddonAsset.GetResource("Star/YesStar.png")?.AsImage(100f)

// Get sprite from Image object
image.GetSprite()

// Role icons
assignable.GetRoleIcon()?.GetSprite()
RoleIcon.GetRoleIconMaterial(assignable, 0.8f)

// Creating SpriteRenderer objects
UnityHelper.CreateObject<SpriteRenderer>("StarButton", screen.transform, new Vector3(2.9f, 2.0f, -1f))

// Setting up Unity buttons
buttonObj.gameObject.SetUpButton(true)
```

### 7. GUIWidget Overlay System (NebulaAPI.GUI)

**For hover overlays / tooltips:**
```csharp
List<GUIWidget> widgets = new();
widgets.Add(NebulaAPI.GUI.RawText(
    GUIAlignment.Left,
    NebulaAPI.GUI.GetAttribute(AttributeAsset.OverlayTitle),
    "Title Text"
));
widgets.Add(NebulaAPI.GUI.RawText(
    GUIAlignment.Left,
    NebulaAPI.GUI.GetAttribute(AttributeAsset.OverlayContent),
    "Content"
));
widgets.Add(NebulaAPI.GUI.Text(
    GUIAlignment.Left,
    NebulaAPI.GUI.GetAttribute(AttributeAsset.OverlayContent),
    new TranslateTextComponent("key")
));

// Image with citation
NebulaAPI.GUI.Image(GUIAlignment.Bottom, citation.LogoImage, new FuzzySize(1.5f, 0.37f))

// Spacing
NebulaAPI.GUI.Margin(new FuzzySize(null, 0.35f))
NebulaAPI.GUI.HorizontalMargin(0.12f)

// Horizontal/vertical holders
NebulaAPI.GUI.HorizontalHolder(GUIAlignment.Left, widget1, widget2, ...)
NebulaAPI.GUI.VerticalHolder(GUIAlignment.Left, widgets)

// Assign back image
holder.BackImage = assignable.ConfigurationHolder?.Illustration;
```

### 8. Configuration Holder UI
```csharp
NebulaAPI.Configurations.Holder(
    NebulaAPI.GUI.LocalizedTextComponent("options.title"),
    NebulaAPI.GUI.LocalizedTextComponent("options.detail"),
    new[] { ConfigurationTab.Settings },
    GameModes.AllGameModes
);
```

### 9. Summary of API Calls by Category

| Purpose | API Entry Point |
|---------|----------------|
| **Create window** | `MetaScreen.GenerateWindow(size, parent, pos, fullScreen, darken, withCloseButton)` |
| **Set widget content** | `screen.SetWidget(widget)`, `screen.SetBackImage(image, alpha)` |
| **Close window** | `screen.CloseScreen()` |
| **Add vertical spacing** | `new MetaWidgetOld.VerticalMargin(0.1f)` |
| **Add horizontal spacing** | `new MetaWidgetOld.HorizonalMargin(0.12f)` |
| **Create text** | `new MetaWidgetOld.Text(attr) { RawText = ..., MyText = ..., TranslationKey = ... }` |
| **Create button** | `new MetaWidgetOld.Button(callback, attr) { ... }` |
| **Combine widgets** | `new CombinedWidgetOld(spacing, items...)` |
| **Scroll view** | `new MetaWidgetOld.ScrollView(size, innerWidget)` |
| **Grid layout** | `inner.Append(items, factory, columns, rows, spacingX, spacingY)` |
| **Load image** | `NebulaAPI.AddonAsset.GetResource(path)?.AsImage(size)` |
| **Get sprite** | `image.GetSprite()` |
| **Create SpriteRenderer** | `UnityHelper.CreateObject<SpriteRenderer>(name, parent, position)` |
| **Setup button interaction** | `gameObject.SetUpButton(true)` |
| **GUIWidget for overlays** | `NebulaAPI.GUI.RawText()`, `.Text()`, `.Image()`, `.Margin()`, `.HorizontalHolder()`, `.VerticalHolder()` |
| **Config holders** | `NebulaAPI.Configurations.Holder(titleComponent, detailComponent, tabs, gameModes)` |
| **Ability buttons** | `NebulaAPI.Modules.AbilityButton(this, player, key, cooldown, translationKey, sprite, ...)`

